[al:新概念英语（一）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:He's Awful!]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.67]Lesson 71 | 第71课
[00:02.95]He's awful! | 他真讨厌!
[00:05.84]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.82]How did Pauline answer the telephone at nine o'clock? | 波琳九点钟是怎么接电话的?
[00:19.64]What's Ron Marston like, Pauline? | 波琳,罗恩·马斯顿是什么样的人?
[00:24.07]He's awful! | 他真讨厌!
[00:26.62]He telephoned me four times yesterday and three times the day before yesterday. | 他昨天给我打了四次电话,前天打了三次。
[00:37.22]He telephoned the office yesterday morning and yesterday afternoon. | 他昨天上午和昨天下午往办公室打了电话。
[00:45.55]My boss answered the telephone. | 我的老板接了电话。
[00:50.14]What did your boss say to him? | 你的老板对他说什么了?
[00:53.80]He said, 'Pauline is typing letters. | 他说:'波琳正在打信。
[00:58.50]She can't speak to you now!' | 她现在不能跟你说话!'
[01:02.36]Then I arrived home at six o'clock yesterday evening. | 然后我昨天傍晚六点回到家。
[01:08.82]He telephoned again. | 他又打来了电话。
[01:11.61]But I didn't answer the phone! | 但我没接电话!
[01:15.67]Did he telephone again last night? | 他昨晚又打来了吗?
[01:19.83]Yes, he did. | 是的,他打了。
[01:22.21]He telephoned at nine o'clock. | 他九点钟打了电话。
[01:26.41]What did you say to him? | 你对他说什么了?
[01:29.67]I said, 'This is Pauline's mother. | 我说:'我是波琳的妈妈。
[01:33.82]Please don't telephone my daughter again!' | 请不要再给我女儿打电话了!'
[01:39.44]Did he telephone again? | 他又打来了吗?
[01:42.10]No, he didn't! | 不,没有!